        </p>
        <ul class="mt-6 space-y-3">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="mt-1 flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-go/10">
              <svg class="h-3 w-3 text-go" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
            </span>
            <span class="text-sm text-foreground font-body">Zero code changes &mdash; just update <code class="rounded bg-secondary px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-mono text-accent">base_url</code></span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="mt-1 flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-go/10">
              <svg class="h-3 w-3 text-go" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
            </span>
            <span class="text-sm text-foreground font-body">Streaming &amp; tool calls work out of the box</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="mt-1 flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-go/10">
              <svg class="h-3 w-3 text-go" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
            </span>
            <span class="text-sm text-foreground font-body">Automatic retry &amp; fallback to the next provider in your chain</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="code-block p-5 md:p-6">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 mb-4">
          <span class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-red-400/80"></span>
          <span class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-yellow-400/80"></span>
          <span class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-green-400/80"></span>
          <span class="ml-3 text-xs text-white/30">quickstart.py</span>
        </div>
        <pre class="whitespace-pre"><span class="cm"># Before: call OpenAI directly</span>
<span class="kw">from</span> openai <span class="kw">import</span> OpenAI

client <span class="op">=</span> <span class="fn">OpenAI</span>(
  api_key<span class="op">=</span><span class="str">"sk-..."</span>,
  base_url<span class="op">=</span><span class="str">"https://api.openai.com/v1"</span>
)

<span class="cm"># After: route through DodoRouter</span>
client <span class="op">=</span> <span class="fn">OpenAI</span>(
  api_key<span class="op">=</span><span class="str">"dr-..."</span>,
  base_url<span class="op">=</span><span class="str">"https://api.dodorouter.com/v1"</span>
)

<span class="cm"># That's it. Same SDK, same types.</span>
resp <span class="op">=</span> client.chat.completions.<span class="fn">create</span>(
  model<span class="op">=</span><span class="str">"my-production-router"</span>,
  messages<span class="op">=</span>[
    {<span class="str">"role"</span>: <span class="str">"user"</span>,
     <span class="str">"content"</span>: <span class="str">"Hello!"</span>}
  ],
  stream<span class="op">=</span><span class="kw">True</span>
)</pre>
